{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309780","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309780","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1130978001:1":{"text":"不想。什么残阳神的宝藏……我是一点兴趣也没有。","source_cn":"不想。什么残阳神的宝藏……我是一点兴趣也没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF820D0197592202B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130978002:1":{"text":"大家都是从小长在高原上，压根没听说过有什么宝藏啊！不明白他们为什么会信那些外来者说的话。","source_cn":"大家都是从小长在高原上，压根没听说过有什么宝藏啊！不明...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11DF8D96FD6FCC06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130978003:1":{"text":"而且我说两句实话还得被骂，说我扫了他们的兴。这都什么事啊……","source_cn":"而且我说两句实话还得被骂，说我扫了他们的兴。这都什么事啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B3DBB6CDE03F6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130978004:1":{"text":"我还是老老实实躲在这吧。就算他们真找到了宝藏，我也不眼红耳热。","source_cn":"我还是老老实实躲在这吧。就算他们真找到了宝藏，我也不眼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82043D450AB7C34C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血戈雷":{"text":"蛮血戈雷","source":"蛮血戈雷","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}